    "enUS": {
      "description": "From the corpse of the defeated serpent you uncover what appears to be a note of some importance: A letter from his superior, General Drakkisath, concerning protocol.\n\nYour instinct tells you that you should take it to Marshal Maxwell.",
      "dialogue": {
        "87bf26487faefefb7fdd": "What have you got there, $N?",
        "b29d7e6133dc4db0d222": "The plot thickens..."
      },
      "summary": "Take General Drakkisath's Command to Marshal Maxwell in Burning Steppes.",
